KPC <%= @trip.number %> - One Week Out (Balance Due)

Hey <%= @golfer.nickname %>,

KPC <%= @trip.number %> tees off in ONE WEEK (<%= @trip.start_date.strftime("%A, %B %-d") %>) and you still have a balance due. Please settle up before we hit the road.

OUTSTANDING BALANCE: $<%= number_with_delimiter(@golfer_trip.balance) %>

PAY UP!
Send payment to <%= ENV["TREASURER_NAME"] %>:
  Venmo:  <%= ENV["TREASURER_VENMO"] %>
  PayPal: <%= ENV["TREASURER_PAYPAL"] %>

YOUR ITINERARY
<% if @nights.any? %>
Nights:
<% @nights.each do |night| %>
  <%= night.date.strftime("%A, %B %-d") %> - $<%= number_with_delimiter(night.cost) %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% if @rounds.any? %>
Rounds:
<% @rounds.each do |round| %>
  <%= round.date.strftime("%A, %B %-d") %> - <%= round.cost == 0 ? "à la carte" : "$#{number_with_delimiter(round.cost)}" %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
